## Edge host (Covenant): workstation-side, manual

Covenant (${EDGE_PUBLIC_IP}) can only be reached by SSH from the workstation, and no new keys
are added there. Its check therefore lives on the workstation and is **not** part of this
timer:

```sh
~/.local/bin/spark-edge-check          # read-only: apt security count, certbot expiry,
                                       # ufw, fail2ban jails, nginx -t
```

Run it after reading the weekly Walter report, or add a workstation cron or systemd
user timer if needed.
